DESCRIPTION:Arturo Vaca is a Los Angeles-based stand-up comedian who has be
 en featured on Laugh Factory Spotlight and has performed at some of LA’s 
 most iconic comedy venues\, including The Laugh Factory Hollywood\, The Com
 edy Store\, and the Hollywood Improv. He has also performed in showcases wi
 th Netflix Is A Joke and Just For Laughs in Canada.\n\nBorn and raised in L
 os Angeles\, Arturo brings an energetic and personal style of comedy to the
  stage\, blending relatable storytelling\, sharp observations\, and crowd w
 ork inspired by family\, relationships\, and growing up in Southern Califor
 nia.\n\nWith a growing audience both onstage and online\, Arturo continues 
 to take his comedy on the road\, building a reputation for connecting with 
 crowds and delivering memorable live performances.\n\nHe produces and hosts
  Vaca Flocka Wednesdays every month at The Laugh Factory.\n\nAges 17+\n\nFe
 e applies if transferring confirmed ticket purchase to another guest.\n\nDo
 ors for open for seating approximately 30 minutes before late showtimes. Pl
 ease note\, doors are subject to prior show endtime and may change without 
 notice\, beyond our control.\n\nNo refunds or exchanges.\n\nTicket resale i
 s strictly prohibited. Any tickets purchased or listed on a third-party res
 ale website or platform is a direct violation of our Venue Policies and wil
 l not be honored\, resulting in denied admission. Third party resale websit
 es and platforms include but are not limited to StubHub\, Vivid Seats\, Sea
 t Geek\, eTickets\, Event Tickets Center\, GoTickets\, Craigslist\, OfferUp
 \, Facebook Marketplace\, etc.\n\nWaitlists are available for sold out show
 s. To join the Waitlist\, you must be present at the venue prior to showtim
 e on the day of the event. You will need to provide your name and how many 
 tickets you'd like to purchase. About 10-15 minutes after the show starts\,
  we will go through our showroom and find the empty seats available and sel
 l tickets in order of arrival.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-a
 tlas/event/arturo-vaca/
